{"uid":"skills/lazyown_objective.py","name":"lazyown_objective.py","qualname":"skills/lazyown_objective.py","kind":"module","file":"skills/lazyown_objective.py","line":1,"end_line":551,"language":"py","signature":"","params":[],"returns":"","decorators":[],"bases":[],"modifiers":[],"visibility":"public","doc":{"summary":"LazyOwn Objective Store ======================= Priority-queue for high-level attack objectives.","description":"Claude Code (the frontier model operating the MCP) is the primary writer and\nreader of this store.  Sub-systems (sessions_watcher, event_engine, auto_loop)\nmay inject objectives automatically when they detect new context.\n\nFile format  — sessions/objectives.jsonl\nEach line    — one JSON object:\n    {\n        \"id\":         \"<8-char hex>\",\n        \"text\":       \"Enumerate SMB shares on 10.10.11.78 (port 445 confirmed open)\",\n        \"priority\":   \"high\",        # critical / high / medium / low\n        \"status\":     \"pending\",     # pending / in_progress / done / blocked / skipped\n        \"source\":     \"claude\",      # claude / watcher / event_engine / user\n        \"context\":    { ... },       # arbitrary dict — facts, event ids, etc.\n        \"created_at\": \"<iso>\",\n        \"updated_at\": \"<iso>\",\n        \"notes\":      \"\"\n    }\n\nPriority order for next_pending():  critical > high > medium > low\nWithin same priority: FIFO (oldest first).\n\nUsage:\n    python3 skills/lazyown_objective.py inject \"Enumerate SMB\" --priority high\n    python3 skills/lazyown_objective.py next\n    python3 skills/lazyown_objective.py list\n    python3 skills/lazyown_objective.py complete <id>\n    python3 skills/lazyown_objective.py block   <id> \"reason\"\n    python3 skills/lazyown_objective.py report","params":[],"returns":null,"yields":null,"raises":[],"attributes":[],"examples":[],"notes":[],"see_also":[],"deprecated":"","since":"","style":"plain"},"parent":"","members":["skills/lazyown_objective.py::BASE_DIR","skills/lazyown_objective.py::SESSIONS_DIR","skills/lazyown_objective.py::OBJECTIVES_FILE","skills/lazyown_objective.py::PLAN_FILE","skills/lazyown_objective.py::SOUL_FILE","skills/lazyown_objective.py::PRIORITY_ORDER","skills/lazyown_objective.py::VALID_STATUSES","skills/lazyown_objective.py::VALID_PRIORITIES","skills/lazyown_objective.py::OBJECTIVE_TTL_HOURS","skills/lazyown_objective.py::DEFAULT_SOUL","skills/lazyown_objective.py::Objective","skills/lazyown_objective.py::ObjectiveStore","skills/lazyown_objective.py::decompose_goal","skills/lazyown_objective.py::read_soul","skills/lazyown_objective.py::write_soul","skills/lazyown_objective.py::current_plan","skills/lazyown_objective.py::full_context_for_claude","skills/lazyown_objective.py::SoulUpdater","skills/lazyown_objective.py::main"],"inferred_raises":[],"returns_value":null,"value":"","base_uids":[],"subclasses":[],"calls":[],"called_by":[]}
